    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2580550863",
      "Source": "Your aggro radius is smaller while you are close to the Veiling Cryptoclidus!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当你靠近帷幕浅隐龙时，你的仇恨范围会变小！","JA":""},
