      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3723465417",
      "Source": "Empiro consumes food and water at half the normal speed. It also recovers 2.5% health and 5% stamina per second.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"帝王龙消耗食物和水的速度为正常速度的一半。它每秒还会恢复2.5%的生命值和5%的耐力。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::331166608",
      "Source": "Kill large creatures to build up Malice. When at 100% Malice, Roar to activate Simmering Malice.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"击杀大型生物以积累恶意值。当恶意值达到100%时，咆哮以激活沸腾恶意。","JA":""},
